  "id": 594,
  "title": "智慧场馆解决方案，让场馆“会说话”！",
  "date": "2024-04-24",
  "summary": "随着场馆复杂和智能程度提升，场馆运维面临数字化转型的具体挑战，传统场馆存在着子系统数据孤岛、运维能力不足、建筑能耗大、智慧化服务不足、设备故障难定位等情况，因此全力发展智慧场馆，让我们实现1:1场景还原。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-594.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-24/2024424113106150.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">在十四五规划文件和数字经济发展报告中，都有明确指出加快建设数字城市，数字中国，旨在深化改革，持续推进我国场馆事业高质量发展。从传统场馆管理到智慧场馆，数字化的发展让我们实现了场馆</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“会说话”的完美转型，今天古河云科技就来聊一聊<a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/programme/physical.html\" target=\"_self\">智慧场馆</a>解决方案。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-4-24/2024424113106150.png\" title=\"95\" alt=\"95\" /><br /></span><span style=\"letter-spacing:0px;\">首先，我们想来了解一下传统场馆的痛点：</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\"><br /></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">随着场馆复杂和智能程度提升，场馆运维面临数字化转型的具体挑战，传统场馆存在着子系统数据孤岛、运维能力不足、建筑能耗大、智慧化服务不足、设备故障难定位等情况，因此全力发展智慧场馆，让我们实现</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">1:1场景还原。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">而智慧场馆都有哪些场景：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">1、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">智能照明场景</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">通过气候信息、人体感应、光照强度等环境参数变化来触发照明情况，自适应光亮调节，实现真智能。</span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;margin-left:0;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">2、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">消防安全场景</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">从报警</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">-发起-调用-处理-查看等四个环节来形成一个闭环，消防安全场景会展示所有消防类设备在楼宇内的空间分布情况，可视化展示消防监控设备的统计信息。在三维场景中展示各种设备的实时 工作状态，并用不同颜色、不同形状的图例进行区分。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-indent:0;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;margin-left:0;\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\">3、</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">人车管理场景</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">对停车场、场馆电梯运行状态等信息进行实时监测，发现人、车异常滞留情况及时告警。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">实时掌握场馆人流、车流态势，快速解决场馆</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“堵、停、满”问题。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">智慧场馆构建具备想象力的智能管理系统，让场馆</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">“会说话”，通过采集、分析、预警、处理，实现一屏通管全闭环。助力场馆降本增效，实现“1”到“100”的蜕变。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;color:#2a2f45;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px;background:#ffffff;font-family:宋体;\">以上就是关于智慧场馆解决方案的一些问题了，相信大家也有了一定的了解，智慧场馆的发展是不可或缺的东西。加快推进场馆数字化转型，提高数字资源开发利用的水平，所以管理者也要紧跟时代发展。</span></p>",
